  "description": "The GoPowerBike GoBreeze Electric Bike is a compact folding e-bike built for convenient everyday travel, city commutes, and space-saving storage. Designed with a distinctive low-step frame and powered by a 350W hub motor, it delivers smooth acceleration and reaches speeds of up to 20 MPH. Its removable 36V lithium-ion battery provides dependable riding range for daily use, while the foldable design makes it easy to store at home, in the office, or in your vehicle.\nMade for comfort and versatility, the GoBreeze offers three riding modes—pedal assist, throttle, and manual pedaling—plus multiple pedal assist levels to match different road conditions and rider preferences. It also features 16\" puncture-resistant tires, dual disc brakes, an LED display, and integrated front and rear lights for added safety and ride control. With practical extras like front and rear fenders, a kickstand, IPX4 water resistance, and a rear passenger seat option, the GoBreeze is a smart folding electric bike for riders who want portability, comfort, and everyday functionality.\n.\n\n20mphTop Speed\n\nUp to 35 miles Range\n\n350W Hub Motor\n\n36V",
